<tr id="mwATk">
<td align="right" id="mwATo">Defeated the 1st-seeded <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022–23_Milwaukee_Bucks_season" title="2022–23 Milwaukee Bucks season" id="mwATs">Milwaukee Bucks</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_NBA_playoffs#(1)_Milwaukee_Bucks_vs._(8)_Miami_Heat" title="2023 NBA playoffs" id="mwATw">4–1</a></td>
