<th colspan="2" id="mwAUU">Conference semifinals</th>
<td align="left" id="mwAUY">Defeated the 4th-seeded <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022–23_Phoenix_Suns_season" title="2022–23 Phoenix Suns season" id="mwAUc">Phoenix Suns</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_NBA_playoffs#(1)_Denver_Nuggets_vs._(4)_Phoenix_Suns" title="2023 NBA playoffs" id="mwAUg">4–2</a></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAUk">
<td align="right" id="mwAUo">Defeated the 2nd-seeded <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022–23_Boston_Celtics_season" title="2022–23 Boston Celtics season" id="mwAUs">Boston Celtics</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2023_NBA_playoffs#(2)_Boston_Celtics_vs._(8)_Miami_Heat" title="2023 NBA playoffs" id="mwAUw">4–3</a></td>
