</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="6" id="mwAVc" aria-labelledby="Series_summary"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Series_summary">Series summary</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2023_NBA_Finals&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="Edit section: Series summary"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAVg">On April 26, the NBA announced that the start times for all the weeknight Finals games will move from 9:00<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAVk"> </span>p.m. to 8:30<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAVo"> </span>p.m. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eastern_Time_Zone" title="Eastern Time Zone" id="mwAVs">EDT</a> for the first time in 20 years. Sunday start times remained at 8:00<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAVw"> </span>p.m. EDT.<sup about="#mwt116" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-NBAschedule_31-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"NBAschedule"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-NBAschedule-31"}}'><a href="#cite_note-NBAschedule-31" id="mwAV0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAV4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAV8">[</span>31<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAWA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt119" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-32" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-32"}}'><a href="#cite_note-32" id="mwAWE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAWI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAWM">[</span>32<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAWQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

